assert word_frequency(["hello-world", "hello_world", "hello.world"]) == {"helloworld": 3}
assert word_frequency(["Python3.8", "Python3.8", "Python_3.8"]) == {"python": 3}
 You should submit your final solution in the following format: ```python

```

