assert calculate_compatibility_scores("Daily", ["Monthly", "Weekly", "Bi-Weekly", "Monthly"]) == {0: 0, 1: 0, 2: 0, 3: 0}
assert calculate_compatibility_scores("Daily", ["Daily"]) == {0: 1}
 You should submit your final solution in the following format: ```python

```

