assert word_frequency(["a_b_c_d", "d_c_b_a", "a_b_c"]) == {'a': 3, 'b': 3, 'c': 3, 'd': 2}
assert word_frequency(["same_same_same", "same"]) == {'same': 4}
 You should submit your final solution in the following format: ```python

```

